5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I think we should look at the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the bank statements on last year's renewals to see how the money is handled.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I'll check the last year's ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on last year's renewals. We need a clear picture of our actual financial standing.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I will look into the minute books from the named-grade years and the taster evening forms from non-joiners to see how different structures affected people.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'll take a look at the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social. I want to see how people are actually feeling about coming along.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll examine the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record. I want to see who is actually showing up and doing the work.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,Does anyone else think we should check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners? I wonder if that makes the treasurer's job harder.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"That is a fair point, Minato. I'll swap the bank statements for the sign-up records for mid-year joiners to see if those calculations are a burden.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Ryuji's adjustment. I'll stick with my choices for now, as I believe understanding the history of our membership grades is essential.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm curious if the sign-in sheets would show the same patterns as the turnout, but Shunichi has that covered. I'll stick with my choices.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'm satisfied with my selection. The data from the rota and sign-in sheets should provide the objective evidence we need regarding member contributions.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I think I'm happy with my choices then. I really want to understand the workload for the treasurer.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am also satisfied. I believe the ledger and the mid-year records will give us the necessary grounding for our calculations.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I am satisfied as well. I believe the historical records and the feedback from non-joiners will provide a balanced perspective on our options.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm satisfied too. I think it's important to understand the human side of why people are or aren't attending before we set a price.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am also satisfied. Let's proceed with these selections so we can analyze the facts before we start debating the figures.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
